OL,3,GNEWSAPM open to giving Cornwall more
OL,4,Adevolved powers
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I want to go with what people want in
OL,7,FCornwall. Cornwall could be so much
OL,8,Fmore if it could do more for itself and
OL,9,Fthat's where I want Cornwall to be
OL,10,Fgoing forward."
